nts":1,"created_at":"2019-05-10T17:49:01Z","updated_at":"2019-05-14T23:36:18Z","closed_at":"2019-05-14T23:36:06Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When inserting into a temporary table with index, an error is hit:\r\n\r\n```\r\npostgres=# create temporary table t (k int primary key, v int);\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\npostgres=# create index on t (v);\r\nCREATE INDEX\r\npostgres=# insert into t values (1, 2);\r\nERROR:  Not found: Error loading table with oid 16391 in database with oid 12448: The object does not exist: table_id: \"000030a0000030008000000000004007\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis happens because the index is a local index but the marked. However, during insert we try to look up the index in the YugaByte storage layer and therefore cannot find the index.","closed_by":{"login":"robertpang","id":30942926,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTQyOTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30942926?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang","html_url":"https://github.com/robertpang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugab